      "quote": "Wedifferentiated between clinical accuracy studies (performed on clinical samples) and analytical accuracy studies (performed on spiked samples with a known quantity of virus). ... we only considered data from clinical accuracy studies as eligible for the meta-analysis. Separately, we summarized the results of analytical studies...",
